# Local custom CA certs for machines behind TLS-inspecting antivirus/proxies
# (Dockerfile trusts these during the build). Never commit an actual cert;
# drop your own .crt/.pem in certificates/ if your network needs it.
certificates/*
!certificates/.gitkeep

